{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]太感谢了！有这么多羽毛，我一定能做出最好看的皮甲。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]希望希瑟老师看见我的作品……能够感到开心。只要她能感到开心……就足够了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]唉？不不不，我可没多想，希瑟老师那样的人，我高攀不上的。至少……我现在还远远配不上她……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“皮匠”埃达","text":"[show]唉，以后或许还有很长的路要走吧……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"wt_c2_03_1","des":"珍贵的装饰鸟羽！"}